Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:04.25,sign_5011_20_The_Kingdom_of_B,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fad(507,455)}Galarc Kingdom, Duke Cretia's territory, Nor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:09.15,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,So, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:11.98,main,Aria,0,0,0,,It could indeed look like a dragon to some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:15.01,main,captain,0,0,0,,Fortunately, it doesn't \Nseem to have noticed us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:17.50,main,captain,0,0,0,,but I decided that continuing our \Nflight to Amande was dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.24,main,captain,0,0,0,,and made an emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.59,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,It was a quick and fitting decision, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:24.38,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,You have my heartfelt gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:29.33,main,captain,0,0,0,,Thank you. I am extremely \Ngrateful to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:30.50,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:33.85,main,Aria,0,0,0,,that appears to be the enchanted \Nairship of Duke Huguenot's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:55.59,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,125)\blur4\fad(897,248)}Spirit Chronicles 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:59.47,main,Aria,0,0,0,,All of you, lower your barriers and \Ncommence attacking individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.75,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Magic Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:10.25,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\blur4\c&H7AFBFF&\fad(897,498)\an1\fs21\fscx79\pos(49.111,297.111)}Heroes and Champions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:10.77,main,Bochsa,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:15.61,main,Bochsa,0,0,0,,Welcome. It has been some \Ntime since last we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:18.76,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,It has indeed, Baronet Bochsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.53,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Hey, Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.87,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Did you meet Beltrum's Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.52,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:31.68,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yes, thankfully. I was able to safely \Ndeliver an invitation to their Hero as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:34.13,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,But whyever are all of you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:38.06,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Huguenot said he had business in Galarc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:42.14,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,He said he'd be stopping in \NAmande, so I tagged along. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:45.74,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,You encountered that while in flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:47.58,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,That's about the size of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.45,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,It seems necessary to meet \Nimmediately to share information
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:54.61,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,and discuss what measures to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:59.06,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Baronet Bochsa, might I ask \Nyou to provide a space for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:03.87,main,Bochsa,0,0,0,,Of course. I'm afraid it isn't very large, \Nbut you're welcome to come to my mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:08.14,sign_5011_20_The_Kingdom_of_B,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fad(507,495)}Beltrum Kingdom, Capital of Marquess Rodan's territory, Rodania
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:10.56,top,Rio,0,0,0,,Marquess Rodan's lands are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.15,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Even though their lord has been \Nbanished from the royal capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:14.90,main,Rio,0,0,0,,this place is very lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.75,main,Celia,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:18.57,main,Celia,0,0,0,,Where is Aishia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.21,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:27.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Aishia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.25,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:33.96,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Are you this lovely lady's attendants?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.97,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.82,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Um, how much do we owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.65,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.40,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,It's that man's treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:47.01,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Do you two want something \Nto eat, too? It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.08,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, no. We couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:51.54,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,No need to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.92,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,He worked to ready the ship for the Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.67,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Apparently he got paid \Na heap of money for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.81,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,He said he wanted to share his luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:02.20,main,Rio,0,0,0,,He prepared a ship for the Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:02.80,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.82,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,And he said something about the \NHeroes who were summoned here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:10.33,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,being invited to some kind \Nof presentation party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:16.06,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What kind of people are the Heroes?\NDo you know their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.32,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:23.70,main,Celia,0,0,0,,Then where is the Hero's \Nship setting sail for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:30.16,main,stall owner,0,0,0,,Oh. They set out today with the \Nprincess and her people for Galarc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:40.46,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,So, basically, it's bad that  \Ndragon-type thing is around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:44.69,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yes. It's certainly not something \Nwe humans are prepared to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:48.10,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,In the worst case, we would have to consider
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.94,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,abandoning the town and \Nevacuating the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:54.73,main,Bochsa,0,0,0,,When it comes to the citizens of Nor,\Nyou may entrust them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.82,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Of course. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.69,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Duke Huguenot, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:05.65,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Indeed. What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.16,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Can I say something, Liselotte?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.57,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What are you guys planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:15.32,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I plan to return to Amande.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:19.65,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I've left a representative in my place, \Nbut I am the governor of that city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.44,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Hang on. You're planning to \Nuse an enchanted airship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.17,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,If you fly in one of those, you'll \Nantagonize that thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.61,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yes, which is why I plan to return by land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:33.93,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Fortunately, if we leave tomorrow morning, \Nwe should arrive while it's still light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:37.30,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Over land? Just you and your lady's maids?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:42.71,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,There is no need for concern. My attendants \Nhave all been trained for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:46.96,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki, you mustn't inquire too \Ndeeply into someone else's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.86,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,You'll bother Lady Liselotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.49,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Roanna. But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:59.21,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,No. I get it. Yes, I understand very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:01.73,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.67,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I'll go with you, Liselotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:05.67,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.28,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:11.68,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I'm a Hero. I can't just stand \Nidly by in this situation, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:12.93,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.53,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Now, wait, Roanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:18.97,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,We cannot simply ignore Sir Hiroaki's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.94,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,B-But, Duke Huguenot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:25.17,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki is a Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:28.45,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,We are in no position to \Ngive orders to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.70,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.15,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Wait, please, Duke Huguenot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:36.09,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki is a Hero from \Na country other than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:39.21,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I can't possibly expose him \Nto danger for our sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.71,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Liselotte, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:48.47,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I am acting as a Hero here. I swore that \NI would help Duke Huguenot and his allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:53.00,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,but that's only under the condition \Nthat I'm convinced it is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.60,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Running off to somewhere safe on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.84,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,That violates my personal \Nsense of aesthetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.85,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,As that is the situation, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:04.31,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Even if the unforeseen should happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:07.37,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,we swear that we shall not press \Nyou to take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.11,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Are you in earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:11.89,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:16.32,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,It would be more trouble if Sir Hiroaki \Nwere to act completely independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:19.08,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Is this satisfactory, Princess Flora?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:22.38,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:27.38,main,Flora,0,0,0,,After all, we couldn't possibly take shelter \Nand leave Sir Hiroaki here on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.87,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,And I'm only escorting \Nthem from here to Amande.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.32,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,It can't be that dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:40.40,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,And if the situation goes bad, that's \Nwhen you should count on me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:44.77,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.61,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,The sign of a Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:50.03,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,my Divine Arms, Yamata no Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:53.28,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yamata no... Orochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:57.28,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm the one who named it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.52,main,Natalie,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.76,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Aria!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:19.02,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Might you be Aria Governess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.43,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:25.09,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Pardon my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:28.22,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,I have been entrusted with your safety today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.69,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,I am a knight captain under Duke Huguenot's \Ncommand. My name is Raymond Brant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.33,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,I am very pleased to meet \Nyou, Lady Liselotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:40.66,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you for looking \Nafter us, Sir Raymond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:43.65,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,And are you an acquaintance of Aria?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:46.88,main,Aria,0,0,0,,It has been quite some time,\N Sir Raymond Brant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:49.38,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Then you really are Aria!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:52.37,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,I've been wondering about you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:56.89,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,What happened to your family was... \NWell, it was very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:03.47,main,Aria,0,0,0,,For you to think of me, someone from a \Nruined family, at all... I'm most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:08.86,main,Aria,0,0,0,,At the moment, fortunately, Lady Liselotte \Nhas taken me in, so I am doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:11.53,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:16.53,main,Huguenot,0,0,0,,It seems the Hero has arrived. \NWill you be ready to leave shortly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:20.03,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Duke Huguenot, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:37.55,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Rattling around in a carriage every \Nonce in a while isn't bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:40.73,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,You mustn't let down your guard, Sir Hiroaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.02,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Don't worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.32,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Princess Flora,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:50.41,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I realize you aren't accustomed to \Nriding in a carriage over rough roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:52.54,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,If you feel uncomfortable,\N please don't hesitate to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.05,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it isn't that. \NI'm just not very good with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:10:00.03,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Listening to others speak like \Nthis is more relaxing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.46,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Please pardon my discourtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:07.40,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,If you'd like, will you speak with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:10.79,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,With all due respect, there is so much \NI'd like to know about you, Princess Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.43,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Yes, I would love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:16.51,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:19.20,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Of course. Would you—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.37,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Stop the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:20.63,main,Aria,0,0,0,,There are monsters in the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.36,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Everyone, battle formations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:33.51,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.69,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.41,main,Alphonse,0,0,0,,What is it? Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.15,main,Stewart,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:43.16,main,Aria,0,0,0,,An incalculable number of monsters lies \Nhidden in the forest on either side of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:49.04,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\fs23\fad(502,1)\pos(512,283)\blur4}Spirit Chronicles {\c&H29FFF4&}2
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.94,italics,Aria; internal,0,0,0,,This isn't right. The monsters' \Npresences appeared so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.05,italics,Aria; internal,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:01.26,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Knights, hurry! Your shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:14.02,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What is this? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:16.23,main,maids,0,0,0,,Magic Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.75,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,If you're wounded, stay near the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:24.62,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Duke Huguenot, please don't come outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:29.25,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Captain Raymond! Please leave \Nthe forward defense to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:31.25,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.33,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,There are monsters on the road to the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.34,main,Natalie,0,0,0,,There are monsters ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:42.08,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,It can't be. A hundred.\NTwo hundred. Three hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.97,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.72,main,Chloe,0,0,0,,They're coming from the woods on either side!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:51.21,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte, please stay low in \Nthe carriage and don't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:54.59,main,Aria,0,0,0,,The walls of the carriage should be \Nable to withstand some thrown rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:56.20,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:59.33,main,Aria,0,0,0,,I will eliminate the enemies ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.99,main,Aria,0,0,0,,After I have commenced my attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:05.33,main,Aria,0,0,0,,all of you, lower your barriers and \Ncommence attacking individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.54,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:07.45,main,maids,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:11.38,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Knights, please continue your defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.27,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Leave the attacking to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.32,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Magic Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:43.54,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,That's the Headhunting Princess \Nfor you. She's so dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:47.02,main,Natalie,0,0,0,,Don't just stand and watch.\NWe have to begin our attacks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:48.63,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:49.58,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Now, Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.96,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Natalie, Chloe, and I will \Nfigure out what to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.61,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,You four, handle the other side, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:57.50,main,Grace,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.74,main,Grace,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.68,main,Grace,0,0,0,,Enchant Physical Ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:07.05,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Chloe, stay behind the knights and use \NPhoto Bullet to defeat the weaker monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.52,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Be careful not to hit our allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.35,main,Chloe,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:14.52,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Now, let's go, Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.51,main,Natalie,0,0,0,,Understood. I'm ready any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.73,main,Cosette; Natalie,0,0,0,,Enchant Physical Ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.64,italics,Reiss; internal,0,0,0,,There is one incredible woman here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:34.48,italics,Reiss; internal,0,0,0,,She must be Liselotte Cretia's \Nweapon and right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:37.39,italics,Reiss; internal,0,0,0,,The defense on either side is quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:42.45,italics,Reiss; internal,0,0,0,,Liselotte's underlings are truly skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:47.43,italics,Reiss; internal,0,0,0,,Still, there are weaknesses to exploit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:49.94,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.36,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.43,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Everything's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:56.04,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:59.19,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Everyone out there is a professional \Nwhen it comes to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:04.00,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Still... there are all those knights,\N and this still isn't done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.44,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:08.45,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Sir Hiroaki, let's trust in everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:12.04,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What? Those guys out there \Nhaven't explained anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:15.13,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I can't trust a bunch of \Npeople I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:17.71,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I'd be a fool to trust them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.71,main,Flora,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:26.97,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:30.87,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I'm embarrassed to admit it, but I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:34.47,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I held \Nhands with you, Princess Flora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:35.85,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.00,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Oh, Roanna! You must be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:45.86,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,If necessary, I'll unleash the power of\N Yamata no Orochi and protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.55,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.39,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,How very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:54.87,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:59.06,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What fell on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.63,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,There isn't a monster up there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.13,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:07.38,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,I've hit my limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:09.58,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,We're going out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:15.03,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,S-Sir Hiroaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:16.45,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:18.62,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Sir Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:21.67,italics,Liselotte; internal,0,0,0,,Honestly! He takes such looking after!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:24.25,main,Flora,0,0,0,,U-Um, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:27.07,main,Flora,0,0,0,,We need to go after Sir Hiroaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:31.46,top,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I'll check the situation outside. Please \Nmake sure not to get separated from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:32.57,main,Flora,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.43,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Magic Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.58,italics,Liselotte; internal,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:46.59,italics,Liselotte; internal,0,0,0,,Were all of these monsters \N hiding in the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:52.23,italics,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Princess Flora, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:52.97,main,Flora,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.89,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,H-Hey! So, you came out, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:00.64,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:04.98,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,All right? Of course not! \NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.02,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Can we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:09.93,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,That isn't for us amateurs to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:14.15,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,But it seems that, at the moment, \Ntheir teamwork is holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.53,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Let's hope that they can \Nmake it through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:21.93,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! What's with this crappy world?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:23.83,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,The Hero with the cheat skills
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:26.79,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,is supposed to be super useful \Nin their first battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:30.67,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,No one wants things to be \Non hard mode like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:31.80,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Lady Roanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:34.55,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Can I ask you to look after Princess Flora?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.74,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I'm going to go use my \Nmagic to treat the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:42.06,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,Of course. I will leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:43.61,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.02,main,Flora,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:47.88,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:55.03,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,What is this? It's like one of those stressful \Nturns of events that always happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:01.45,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Are you conscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.62,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:07.19,main,Aria,0,0,0,,My lady, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:10.92,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Yes, but more importantly, \Nwhat's the situation right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:15.15,main,Aria,0,0,0,,We're being pressed into defense \Non either side and the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:18.11,main,Aria,0,0,0,,I've taken care of most of \Nthe monsters to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:20.40,main,Aria,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the remainder \Nto the other attendants
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:23.64,main,Aria,0,0,0,,and I'm on my way to support the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:27.30,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I see. Then, take care \Nof it quickly, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.65,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,I'm depending on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:31.78,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Understood. I will be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:37.66,italics,Liselotte; internal,0,0,0,,All right. Now, I have to do \Nthe things that I can do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:44.87,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,So, she's gone to the rear. \NIt seems the diversion was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:45.94,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:51.42,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,She's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:18:01.14,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,Is it the power of that enchanted blade?\NNo, the power is hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.03,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.67,main,Aria,0,0,0,,I believe I will suffice to take \Ncare of the monsters in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:09.98,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Can I ask you to go and support \Nthe flanks and the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:13.48,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,R-Really? You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:18.26,main,Raymond,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:28.21,italics,Liselotte; internal,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:30.74,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,I-Is that the one from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:34.70,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Lady Roanna, have you \Nseen that monster before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.76,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,I-It's a minotaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:42.05,main,Roanna,0,0,0,,It's a legendary monster that \Nraged during the Divine-Demon War!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.94,main,Sakata,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. That's the end for us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:52.54,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.70,0:19:09.04,main,Aria,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.12,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,Princess Flora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:27.83,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:38.09,italics,Flora; internal,0,0,0,,It's just like back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.09,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,Lady Liselotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:49.06,main,Natalie,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:55.98,main,Rio,0,0,0,,We can talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:00.61,main,Liselotte,0,0,0,,An enchanted sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:20.67,main,Cosette,0,0,0,,That can't be real! He knocked \Nthat giant monster away?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:53.59,main,knights,0,0,0,,Hooray! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:45.02,sign_33925_315_Next_Time_Royal_,text; top line,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,120)\blur1.5\3c&HF489C7&\shad0}Next Time
